&lt;p>在微服务、Kubernetes、云原生这些语境里，经常会听到几个相近的词：&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Pulumi 入门：原理、组件与 IaC 工作流</title><link>https://yindongliang.com/docs/Linux/Pulumi-%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%E7%BB%84%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8E-IaC-%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E6%B5%81/</link><pubDate>Wed, 24 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yindongliang.com/docs/Linux/Pulumi-%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%E7%BB%84%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8E-IaC-%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E6%B5%81/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote class='book-hint '>
